   286	| State | Current rung; append each judgement with reasons and whether the conclusion changed. A memo-derived thesis is not yet judged until evidence first links to it. | Strongly bearish |
   287	| Dependency | Dependency targets and directions; for uncreated targets, the awaited chain and year | → China chip export licensing: easing is bullish |
