   105	## 6. What this would change in the pipeline, if the POC holds
   106	
   107	The extraction schema stays. Membership authority widens: a Jev `true` above threshold adds a membership with `basis=jev` beside the model's citation and the alias hit; a union adds and never removes, so wrong model memberships need their own rule. Identity stays with the key gate and the matching call; Jev's `same` is advisory until a separate identity result justifies more. Both are product changes under D149 and D166, so each needs a decision, measured on the next window before any default changes (AGENTS §5, §7).
