Conclusion
August 26 is the test, and it is a narrow one. NVIDIA reports fiscal Q2 2027 after the close against guidance of $91 billion, and the line to watch is not that number. It is whether any CPU revenue appears separately, or whether standalone Vera stays a figure management describes rather than reports. Two quarters of visibility without disclosure would tell that the $20 billion is harder to isolate than the May call implied.
